{"schemaVersion":1,"unitId":"u016","words":[{"word":"garden","phonetic":"/ˈɡɑːdn/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 花园，庭院","pos":"n","usage":"指种植花草树木的地方，也可指菜园"}]},{"word":"tree","phonetic":"/triː/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 树，树木","pos":"n","usage":"指木本植物，通常有树干和树枝"}]},{"word":"climb","phonetic":"/klaɪm/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 爬，攀爬","pos":"v","usage":"指用手脚向上移动，也可用于攀登阶梯等"}]},{"word":"grass","phonetic":"/ɡrɑːs/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 草，草地","pos":"n","usage":"指户外的草坪或草原"}]},{"word":"run","phonetic":"/rʌn/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 跑，奔跑","pos":"v","usage":"指用脚快速移动，也可用于机器运转等"}]},{"word":"after","phonetic":"/ˈɑːftə/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 在...之后","pos":"prep","usage":"表示时间顺序或空间位置；run after表示追赶"},{"meaning":"追逐"}]},{"word":"cat","phonetic":"/kæt/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 猫","pos":"n","usage":"指家养的猫科动物"}]},{"word":"dog","phonetic":"/dɒɡ/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 狗","pos":"n","usage":"指家养的犬科动物"}]},{"word":"pardon","phonetic":"/ˈpɑːdn/","meanings":[{"meaning":"interj.. 请再说一遍","usage":"用于没听清对方说话时请对方重复"},{"meaning":"对不起"}]},{"word":"under","phonetic":"/ˈʌndə/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 在...下面","pos":"prep","usage":"表示位置关系，指在某物的正下方"}]},{"word":"sit","phonetic":"/sɪt/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 坐，坐下","pos":"v","usage":"指坐在某处，用进行时表示坐着的状态"}]},{"word":"across","phonetic":"/əˈkrɒs/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 穿过，横穿","pos":"prep","usage":"表示从一边到另一边的动作"}]},{"word":"too","phonetic":"/tuː/","meanings":[{"meaning":". 也，同样","pos":"adv","usage":"用于肯定句句末，表示也适用于其他人或物"}]}],"phrases":[{"phrase":"I beg your pardon","usage":"礼貌用语，用于没听清或没听懂对方说的话时，请求重复","examples":[{"en":"I beg your pardon? Could you say that again?","zh":"请再说一遍好吗？"}]},{"phrase":"What about","usage":"用于询问关于某人或某事的情况，或提出建议","examples":[{"en":"What about the dog?","zh":"那只狗呢？"}]},{"phrase":"run after","usage":"表示追赶、追逐某人或某物","examples":[{"en":"The dog is running after a cat.","zh":"那只狗正在追一只猫。"}]},{"phrase":"across the grass","usage":"穿过草地，表示从草地的一端到另一端","examples":[{"en":"It's running across the grass.","zh":"它正在穿过草地跑。"}]},{"phrase":"under the tree","usage":"在树下，表示位置在树的下方","examples":[{"en":"She's sitting under the tree.","zh":"她正坐在树下。"}]},{"phrase":"in the garden","usage":"在花园里，表示位置在花园内部","examples":[{"en":"Tim is in the garden.","zh":"Tim在花园里。"}]}],"grammar":[{"title":"现在进行时 (Present Continuous Tense)","structure":"主语 + am/is/are + 动词-ing + 其他","definition":"表示正在进行的动作或发生的事，由be动词(am/is/are) + 动词-ing形式构成 用于描述说话时正在发生的动作","examples":[{"en":"She's sitting under the tree.","zh":"她正坐在树下。"},{"en":"He's climbing the tree.","zh":"他正在爬树。"},{"en":"It's running across the grass.","zh":"它正在穿过草地跑。"}]},{"title":"现在进行时的Yes/No疑问句","structure":"Is/Are + 主语 + 动词-ing + 其他?","definition":"将be动词提到句首构成一般疑问句，语调用升调 用于询问某人是否正在做某事","examples":[{"en":"Is Tim in the garden, too?","zh":"Tim也在花园里吗？"},{"en":"Is the cat climbing the tree?","zh":"那只猫正在爬树吗？"},{"en":"What's she doing?","zh":"她正在做什么？"}]},{"title":"Where引导的特殊疑问句","structure":"Where + is/are + 主语?","definition":"用where提问地点，句式为Where + be动词 + 主语? 用于询问某人或某物在哪里","examples":[{"en":"Where's Sally, Jack?","zh":"Sally在哪里，Jack？"},{"en":"Where are the children?","zh":"孩子们在哪里？"}]}],"patterns":[{"pattern":"Where + be动词 + 主语?","original":{"en":"Where's Sally, Jack?","zh":"Sally在哪里，Jack？"},"imitations":[{"en":"Where's Tom?","zh":"Tom在哪里？"},{"en":"Where are my keys?","zh":"我的钥匙在哪里？"}]},{"pattern":"What's + 主语 + doing?","original":{"en":"What's she doing?","zh":"她正在做什么？"},"imitations":[{"en":"What's Tim doing?","zh":"Tim正在做什么？"},{"en":"What's the dog doing?","zh":"那只狗正在做什么？"}]},{"pattern":"Is/Are + 主语 + 动词-ing + 其他?","original":{"en":"Is Tim in the garden, too?","zh":"Tim也在花园里吗？"},"imitations":[{"en":"Is he climbing the tree?","zh":"他正在爬树吗？"},{"en":"Are the children playing in the garden?","zh":"孩子们正在花园里玩吗？"}]},{"pattern":"What about + 名词/代词?","original":{"en":"What about the dog?","zh":"那只狗呢？"},"imitations":[{"en":"What about your sister?","zh":"你姐姐呢？"},{"en":"What about this book?","zh":"这本书怎么样？"}]}]}